Scenario

You are given two small datasets from a healthcare system.

Table A: Patients


patient_id	name	birth_date	sex
P001	Jane Smith	1990-04-12	F
P002	John Doe	1985-09-30	M


Table B: Visits
visit_id	patient_id	visit_date	diagnosis_code
V1001	P001	2024-01-10	I10
V1002	P002	2024-01-15	E11
Tasks
1.	Identify the join key
o	Which field connects Table A and Table B?
2.	Identify value types
o	For each field below, identify its value type
(ID, text, date, or code)
o	patient_id
o	birth_date
o	visit_date
o	diagnosis_code
3.	Describe the relationship
o	In 1–2 sentences, describe how the two tables are related.
4.	Reflection (guided)
o	Would this data be easier to represent in:
	a relational database
	or a graph database?
o	Briefly explain your reasoning.
 
Submission
•	Answer directly in this file or
•	Submit a short written response (½–1 page) as instructed by your supervisor.

